{'symbol': 'SPG', 'date': '2023-05-22 13:45:00', 'title': 'SIMON® EXPANDS SUCCESSFUL DIGITAL SEARCH PLATFORM TO THE MILLS® AND PREMIUM OUTLETS®', 'text': "INDIANAPOLIS , MAY 22, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SIMON® ANNOUNCED THE EXPANSION OF ITS SUCCESSFUL DIGITAL SEARCH PLATFORM, SIMON SEARCH™, TO THE MILLS®\xa0AND PREMIUM OUTLETS®. SIMON SEARCH WAS LAUNCHED IN JUNE 2022 AND IS NOW AVAILABLE AT 187 SIMON DESTINATIONS, ALLOWING SHOPPERS TO SEARCH THEIR FAVORITE SIMON CENTER FOR WHAT THEY'RE LOOKING FOR ACROSS 50+ BRANDS AT OVER 3,300 STORES, CONVENIENTLY ACCESSIBLE VIA THE SIMON WEBSITE AND APP, AS WELL AS ON-MALL DIGITAL DIRECTORIES."}